WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.320
Football was a pretty big thing but the stadium in those days was only . . . Was open at both ends and it . . . It only went up about twenty rows up this way and it was down there.

2
00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:24.440
We kind of ushered sometimes and when you played in the band, you played . . . The students in those days sat in the middle.

3
00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:27.800
And the outsiders had to take the outside seats.

4
00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:29.820
Oh, so the students got the best seats.

5
00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:33.980
Now they put them off on the end where more money coming in over here because it’s . . . And,

6
00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:39.200
of course there’re more people involved in this game.

7
00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:47.540
You had . . . The teams in those days played both . . . same bunch of men played generally the defense and the offense, you see.

8
00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:52.260
So you didn’t have as many football stars as . . . as you have now.

9
00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:58.620
You have your kicker now and you have . . . everything else is specialized.

10
00:00:58.620 --> 00:01:01.720
Did the band go to all the football games?

11
00:01:01.720 --> 00:01:03.020
Would you travel with the team?

12
00:01:03.020 --> 00:01:03.620
Oh yes.

13
00:01:03.620 --> 00:01:08.760
You pretty much went to . . . went to nearly all the basketball games, too.

14
00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:14.200
And on the weekends, if you didn’t rate the dance that weekend,

15
00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:28.100
you didn’t . . . you [could do a bull session?] any place or you had . . . And also on weekends we did touch football games out on the side and . . . Well we always amused ourselves and there wasn’t an idle moment.
